<title>USA: Heartland Partners LP Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>Heartland Partners LP Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(amounts in thousands, except per unit data, unaudited)</p>
<p>					    Qtr Ended	   Qtr Ended</p>
<p>					 Mar 31, 1997	Mar 31, 1996</p>
<p> Total net revenues			  $482		  $490</p>
<p> Total expenses			     1,729		 1,521</p>
<p>  Net loss				  (1,247)	     (1,031)</p>
<p>  Net loss per Class A unit (a)	 (.57)		 (.47)</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Net income (loss) per Class A unit compiled by dividing net income (loss), after deducting general partners' return and return of Class B interest, by 2.1 million Class A units outstanding.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
